              "Description": "Ontology Summary",
              "Value": {
                "StringWithMarkup": [
                  {
                    "String": "L-glutamine zwitterion is an amino acid zwitterion arising from transfer of a proton from the carboxy to the amino group of L-glutamine; major species at pH 7.3. It has a role as a metabolite. It is an amino-acid zwitterion and a polar amino acid zwitterion. It is a tautomer of a L-glutamine.",
